{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think with physics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange planet built on logic and reaction. Move, charge, and connect cores to activate mechanisms that reshape the environment, unlocking paths, powering bridges, and revealing the ruins beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve together or alone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a single-player campaign or experience it with a friend. Puzzle Parasite also features a dedicated co-op campaign, built around communication, timing, and shared problem-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built with care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is built with intention. A focused, curated experience where every puzzle is designed to challenge your logic and reward curiosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet thrilling first-person puzzle adventure along with calm and satisfying sound effects and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person room based puzzle challenges where every level is intentionally designed: no filler, no repetition, players figure out the mystery at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core actions specifically hand crafted to make them feel smooth &amp; satisfying every time you use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging core mechanic focused on physics, logic, observation, and satisfying chain-reaction problem-solving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965930/6db70c0c29650d446d83ab2fb1a7482721535b37.jpg"},{"name":"Sunset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3965930/a825ce98892e0feceb0c3fd1d4c2b1f73c013c44.jpg"},{"name":"Forty In Forty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati